### Relatório financeiro administrativo (requer x-admin-api-key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/financial-report?page=1&size=20
x-admin-api-key: dev-only-admin-key-change-me

### Deletar usuário (requer x-admin-api-key)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
x-admin-api-key: dev-only-admin-key-change-me
